{"4160010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chromatic Battles", "steam_appid": 4160010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your rotating ship and survive enemy waves by matching colors to save the planet Kaleida in <i>Chromatic Battles</i>, a game that blends shooters and survival into a challenging action experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/extras/48a73be8d296e2fdb3536f2fecc04686.poster.avif?t=1773266114\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/extras/48a73be8d296e2fdb3536f2fecc04686.webm?t=1773266114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/extras/48a73be8d296e2fdb3536f2fecc04686.mp4?t=1773266114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your crew on a space mission to collect the 7 chromatic crystals and save your planet from catastrophe. You'll travel across different planets, surviving hordes of enemies, upgrading your weapons, and completing your logbook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/extras/27cf815239e80d6568cfbf2d9cd4e0a6.poster.avif?t=1773266114\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/extras/27cf815239e80d6568cfbf2d9cd4e0a6.webm?t=1773266114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/extras/27cf815239e80d6568cfbf2d9cd4e0a6.mp4?t=1773266114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color-Based Combat:</strong><br>Your survival depends on mastering the language of color. Each enemy has a unique hue and is only vulnerable to bullets of the same color. Rotate your ship, dynamically switch your weapon colors, and synchronize your shots to create devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between-Waves Strategy:</strong><br>Before each level, equip your ship in the shop. Upgrade weapons, unlock abilities, and choose items that suit your playstyle. Every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Planets:</strong><br>No two playthroughs are the same. Explore alien worlds, each with new colors, enemies, and attack patterns. Master themed planets, each with its own unique final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression:</strong><br>Unlock new colors, weapons, and abilities with each conquered planet. Experiment with strategic combinations and customize your ship to face increasingly complex challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Futuristic Style:</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a visually striking universe inspired by classic sci-fi, featuring vibrant cartoon art and a synthwave soundtrack that transports you to an epic space adventure.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your rotating ship and survive enemy waves by matching colors to save the planet Kaleida in <i>Chromatic Battles</i>, a game that blends shooters and survival into a challenging action experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/extras/48a73be8d296e2fdb3536f2fecc04686.poster.avif?t=1773266114\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/extras/48a73be8d296e2fdb3536f2fecc04686.webm?t=1773266114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/extras/48a73be8d296e2fdb3536f2fecc04686.mp4?t=1773266114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your crew on a space mission to collect the 7 chromatic crystals and save your planet from catastrophe. You'll travel across different planets, surviving hordes of enemies, upgrading your weapons, and completing your logbook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/extras/27cf815239e80d6568cfbf2d9cd4e0a6.poster.avif?t=1773266114\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/extras/27cf815239e80d6568cfbf2d9cd4e0a6.webm?t=1773266114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/extras/27cf815239e80d6568cfbf2d9cd4e0a6.mp4?t=1773266114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color-Based Combat:</strong><br>Your survival depends on mastering the language of color. Each enemy has a unique hue and is only vulnerable to bullets of the same color. Rotate your ship, dynamically switch your weapon colors, and synchronize your shots to create devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between-Waves Strategy:</strong><br>Before each level, equip your ship in the shop. Upgrade weapons, unlock abilities, and choose items that suit your playstyle. Every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Planets:</strong><br>No two playthroughs are the same. Explore alien worlds, each with new colors, enemies, and attack patterns. Master themed planets, each with its own unique final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression:</strong><br>Unlock new colors, weapons, and abilities with each conquered planet. Experiment with strategic combinations and customize your ship to face increasingly complex challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Futuristic Style:</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a visually striking universe inspired by classic sci-fi, featuring vibrant cartoon art and a synthwave soundtrack that transports you to an epic space adventure.</p>", "short_description": "Match colors to survive enemy waves. Control and upgrade your rotating ship in this shooter-survival blend. Journey through space to save Kaleida!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/c7fc4611819b10a9122edeab910019eaf09bf2df/header.jpg?t=1773266114", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/8b68c99a0dc30ba0d93dff372a675db667d08589/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773266114", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160010/8b68c99a0dc30ba0d93dff372a675db667d08589/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773266114", "website": "https://nightwavegames.netlify.app/chromatic-battles", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended: